# Terraform local data and secrets
**/.terraform/**
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
**/*.tfplan
**/*.plan
**/.secure-state/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
# Generated API bundles are kept out; build them from reviewed application source.
api/dist/*.zip
!aws/u2-lambda-web/web.zip
